Downloaded by the service (not part of this product)
----------------------------------------------------

Every file is pinned by URL, size and SHA-256: the upscalers in crates/qls-core/src/catalog.rs,
the lab models in crates/qls-core/src/matting.rs.

- MobileSAM (Apache-2.0) in Acly's ONNX export (MIT), and BiRefNet-lite (MIT; onnx-community's
  ONNX export) — the lab's click-to-select and matte models; see the pinned pages in
  crates/qls-core/src/matting.rs for the terms.
- 4x_NMKD-Superscale-SP_178000_G upscaler by Nmkd (the default), WTFPL, from
  https://huggingface.co/uwg/upscaler.
- 4x-UltraSharp upscaler by Kim2091 (optional, downloaded from Settings), CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
  (non-commercial), from https://huggingface.co/uwg/upscaler.

The engine box's files (the stable-diffusion.cpp build, Qwen-Image and its encoders, the
upscalers it serves) are pinned by the deployment, not by this product: see
docs/fresh-box.md and the ml repository.
